    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d139">

                <pb facs="0249" n="145" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg145"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.51/1220.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Chargé d’Affaires at
                            London to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-01-07">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 7, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The following urgent memorandum from the Minister for Foreign Affairs just
                    received. I respectfully request an early expression of your views since I am
                    informed that a meeting of the representatives of the six groups is to take
                    place here in a few days.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Laughlin</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d139-a1.xml" xpointer="d139-a1"/>
